Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:09.00,zhu,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}本字幕由豌豆字幕組製作 僅供學習交流 禁止用於商業用途
Comment: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:23.02,op-jp,,0,0,0,,==========OP==========
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.53,op-jp,,0,0,0,,緊急事態みたいだレスキュー
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:42.24,op-jp,,0,0,0,,僕ら彷徨うわバッドサイレンス
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:44.58,op-jp,,0,0,0,,会いたい人がいる天国
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.29,op-jp,,0,0,0,,そっから僕たちはどう見える
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:49.71,op-jp,,0,0,0,,何もかもおかしい時代で
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:52.25,op-jp,,0,0,0,,ぎりぎりを踏み外さないで
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:55.01,op-jp,,0,0,0,,しっかり手を繋いでいて
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.01,0:05:57.51,op-jp,,0,0,0,,抱きしめる心許ない形を
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:06:00.01,op-jp,,0,0,0,,青く燃やす炎は蜃気楼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:02.51,op-jp,,0,0,0,,手に増やす土産話を
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:06.89,op-jp,,0,0,0,,君を思えば僕は
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:07.52,op-jp,,0,0,0,,飛べ！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:11.11,op-jp,,0,0,0,,はじまりはそうだ　あくまでもいいからベイベー
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.52,op-jp,,0,0,0,,手を貸して
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:15.07,op-jp,,0,0,0,,責めるほど増えるヘイト
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:17.39,op-jp,,0,0,0,,終われないんだよここで　
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:22.37,op-jp,,0,0,0,,今僕が選ぶのはいつかで終わらぬ証明　venez m'aider
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:25.15,op-jp,,0,0,0,,守りたい　見てみたいのは
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:29.71,op-jp,,0,0,0,,絶やさない鼓動　未来への応答
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:45.31,op-jp,,0,0,0,,緊急事態みたいだレスキュー
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.31,0:06:47.89,op-jp,,0,0,0,,僕ら彷徨うわバッドサイレンス
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:50.19,op-jp,,0,0,0,,会いたい君がいる現在地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:52.24,op-jp,,0,0,0,,今も聞こえるミュージック
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.53,op-cn,,0,0,0,,求救信號宣告情況緊急
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:42.24,op-cn,,0,0,0,,警告鳴響令人彷徨無措
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:44.58,op-cn,,0,0,0,,思念之人遠在天國
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.29,op-cn,,0,0,0,,眼中的我們是何模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:49.71,op-cn,,0,0,0,,在脫離常軌的時代
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:52.25,op-cn,,0,0,0,,小心翼翼穩住腳步
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:55.01,op-cn,,0,0,0,,我們緊緊牽著手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.01,0:05:57.51,op-cn,,0,0,0,,抱作一團瑟瑟發抖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:06:00.01,op-cn,,0,0,0,,燃燒的青焰如海市蜃樓
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:02.51,op-cn,,0,0,0,,回憶越來越多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:06.89,op-cn,,0,0,0,,只要為了你 我便無所不能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:07.52,op-cn,,0,0,0,,飛吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:11.11,op-cn,,0,0,0,,起初都是這樣 是惡魔也無妨 寶貝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.52,op-cn,,0,0,0,,把手給我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:15.07,op-cn,,0,0,0,,越是苛責 越是憎恨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:17.39,op-cn,,0,0,0,,不能止步於此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:22.37,op-cn,,0,0,0,,我們要選擇的是永恆的證明 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:25.15,op-cn,,0,0,0,,想要嘗試去保護的是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:29.71,op-cn,,0,0,0,,不停歇的鼓動 給未來的回應
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:45.31,op-cn,,0,0,0,,求救信號宣告情況緊急
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.31,0:06:47.89,op-cn,,0,0,0,,警告鳴響令人彷徨無措
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:50.19,op-cn,,0,0,0,,思念的你就在此處
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:52.24,op-cn,,0,0,0,,音樂依舊迴響不止
Comment: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:05.05,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,==========ED==========
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.01,0:22:19.62,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}描き出したストーリーが2人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.62,0:22:26.36,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}交わらせた意味は 未だにわからない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.93,0:22:30.67,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}そばにいてもひとりみたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.67,0:22:37.21,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}いつの間に僕らは 離れてしまったの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:45.06,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}誰にも 見せぬまま 言えぬまま
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:47.82,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}心は荒れ模様
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:57.86,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}君の綺麗な 声が 祈りが
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.86,0:23:03.36,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}僕の胸暴いて しまうからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:08.89,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}君の綺麗な 愛が 命が
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.89,0:23:14.38,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}僕の目貫いて しまえばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.38,0:23:20.39,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}ただ生きてていいんだって 笑うから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.01,0:22:19.62,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}故事之中 是兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.62,0:22:26.36,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}至今仍不明白 為何會相識
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.93,0:22:30.67,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}即使相伴 依舊孤獨
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.67,0:22:37.21,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}不知不覺中 我們漸行漸遠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:45.06,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}不願向人展露 不願對人傾訴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:47.82,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}內心亂作一團
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:57.86,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}你那柔美的聲音與祈禱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.86,0:23:03.36,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}將我的內心 揭露無遺
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:08.89,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}你那絢麗的愛與生命
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.89,0:23:14.38,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}只希望它們 貫穿我的眼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.38,0:23:20.39,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我會笑著說 你只要活著就好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:05.99,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正细雅宋_GBK\fad(1061,934)\shad3\bord0.1\an3\fs60\pos(1833.34,925.33)}第12集{\fsp3}「訣別」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.06,0:23:40.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正细雅宋_GBK\shad3\bord0.1\fs50\b1\pos(960,786.18)}下集{\fs30}\N\N{\fs60\fsp3}「獅郎與尤莉」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.15,0:00:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,為了讓我們逃走 大家都來幫忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我們去坐電車盡可能跑遠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,到末班車的終點找旅館住下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有話之後再說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.99,0:00:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,雪男？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你早晚會來救我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到來得這麼快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼每次都要來幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我們明明是同樣的出身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你難道不想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那隻眼睛的真相 以及你出生的秘密嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,這些真相能給予你力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,奧村老師
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.37,0:01:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你在這裡已經待不下去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,志摩？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.55,0:01:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你少開玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,雪男怎麼可能會去啟明結社
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我能給予你力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你很弱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,雪男？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.46,0:01:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥 最後告訴你一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.39,0:02:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,正十字騎士團和啟明結社並沒有區別
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.84,0:02:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,梅菲斯特曾經為了製造惡魔的容器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,使用了大量活人做實驗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,更有甚之 啟明結社就是騎士團催生出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 爸爸就是實驗中誕生的實驗體
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是被作為驅魔師培養出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的人 到底有沒有人心都是個問題
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.03,0:02:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,實際上 他撫養我們就是為了把我們當武器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,把我們當道具
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,才沒這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我不知道老爺子的身世吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.61,0:02:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我所知道的老爺子…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你說的那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也對
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他對你應該不一樣 畢竟你很特別
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但我很弱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我是瑕疵品
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定嫌我很礙眼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你…到底在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,很認真 很愛學習
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,個子很高 很懂事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.87,0:03:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很溫柔 受女生歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但又很謙虛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,很聰明 長大想當醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是老爺子和我的驕傲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你在看什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.03,0:03:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把你那起了霧的眼鏡擦乾淨 看清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你誤會了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.94,0:03:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我去讓梅菲斯特說出真相
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,無所謂了 我對這裡沒有留戀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會讓你去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我想變強
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,奧村老師是不是舉著槍？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小雪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他很認真…很愛學習…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而且很不服輸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經不需要你的幫助了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,燐 小雪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,杜山詩惠美
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,正是關鍵時候呢 不要礙事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你讓開 這樣下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定…又是營養劑…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他這次是…動真格的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是…我到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底看了些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不 在我看來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥才是完美的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟不要吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,燐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,降魔劍…斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我因為意外事件臥床不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,差點錯過了最精彩的好戲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,父親
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛才砍向我的時候 劍斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你這不是下得了手嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不過很快就會恢復理智 還挺溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,因為這就是你的極限
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那隻眼睛…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,總算給你解開了那個可恨的束縛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,撒旦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見了啊 兒子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,其實我時不時在看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,多虧這個眼鏡小鬼 我們總算能父子對話了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,難道你控制了雪男？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有 我還是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,撒旦是獨立的 在擅自說話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等 等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,該覺醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,薩麥爾把你鍛鍊得挺好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,應該已經不是之前那個黃毛小子了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,這具人類之身 差不多也能耐受住完整的力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等你成功耐受住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那具身體就是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟這是說好了的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,小雪 不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不許妨礙父親
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 別遮住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 快把我帶過去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小雪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,雪男…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道去了啟明結社後會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,或許我也會死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,萬一我們兩個都活了下來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就會比你更強
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一定會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙再見啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.95,0:09:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,志摩…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,志摩…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,燐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,奧村 你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,別過來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,燐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有趣起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛 好痛 好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.69,0:10:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,比那個時候痛得多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要輸給力量了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,雪男
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,奧村…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他的身體…正在壞死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,燐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,兄長果然把奧村燐的惡魔心臟封印在了虛無界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,封印心臟的降魔劍斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所以惡魔心臟失去束縛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,徹底回到了奧村燐的體內
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,虛無界之物要干涉物質界 就必須處於對等地位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,奧村燐的身體能否耐受住完整的力量呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要是沒耐受住 會怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,會死掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.43,0:11:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我本想看看奧村燐夠不夠當父親的容器來著
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,結果呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,也就那樣嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:11:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會…奧村…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能 肯定很快就會復活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是奧村燐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,燐…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,惡魔的心臟？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:12:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,燐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,詩惠美？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.77,0:13:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,奧村
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好熱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他是燐…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但又不是燐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小尼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,力量湧了上來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.65,0:13:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,杜山
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,植物構成了牆壁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那女人果然是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 如果是這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,森林？樹叢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,詩惠美做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,詩惠美好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好想毀了它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,它已經撐不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.91,0:14:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,奧村 你快醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快停下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好想把這力量全部放出來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.71,0:14:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你們是朋友 應該願意接受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,燐在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.31,0:14:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你是…什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你明明知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你一直壓抑著的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我終於出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你就消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,這怎麼行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你想殺死大家 我不能放任你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 我也不能放著雪男不管
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他是為了自己的目的 自願離開的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.69,0:15:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,別管他就是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.93,0:15:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我是弱小的瑕疵品 他肯定嫌我很礙眼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼能讓他留下那種話就離開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 那時我沒能拿出自信這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我毫不知情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,膽小鬼到底是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,弱爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,又是想變溫柔又是猶豫不決
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然還把我壓制了這麼久 想想就來氣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍無可忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你壓抑了16年的憤怒和欲望
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是力量本身
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.74,0:16:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有力量才有權支配
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,這是理所當然吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.84,0:16:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,對 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我害怕了 我是膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在逃避你 逃避過去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不弱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我的16年 是屬於我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我絕對要保護好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,這具身體不會交給你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,這次就到這裡好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你聽好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.31,0:17:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,「我果然是撒旦之子 無法逃離這股力量」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,這可是你自己說的 別忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大…家…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,奧 奧村
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,杜山詩惠美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.07,0:18:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,這誰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.47,0:18:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,頭髮…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且告訴你一聲 其他人都沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.31,0:18:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,斷掉的降魔劍也送到應去的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.11,0:18:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,問題是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在是哪個奧村燐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,希望不是兇暴的那個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟我也大病初癒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,梅菲斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.87,0:18:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴我吧 我和雪男是怎麼出生的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,撒旦的事 媽媽的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,老爺子是個怎樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我必須知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:19:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我等的就是你這句話 奧村
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,現在的你應當知道這些 做好心理準備了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快點告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不過你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我必須處理這邊的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你一個人去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,去？去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,過去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.87,0:19:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你應該已經帶在身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.93,0:19:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,通向過去的門鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,鑰匙？什麼鑰匙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,對 這是「神隱鑰匙」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.27,0:19:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,能讓持有者去往想去的維度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.57,0:19:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是獨一無二的萬能鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這個？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直帶著的啊 怎麼不早說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,凡事都要講時機
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.14,0:19:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.28,0:19:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,這是餞別禮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,給你這身特務巡邏隊的制服
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,能進入幾乎所有地方 並隱藏身形
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是我特製的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,順便再幫你把心臟藏起來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.27,0:20:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,隨便哪扇門都行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.59,0:20:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,先把門關上 插入鑰匙再打開
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.81,0:20:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,它就能把你帶到想去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.65,0:20:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？怎麼了 你害怕了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,當然害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,原本我是盡量不想知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,比起我 我更希望你能告訴雪男
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他很想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這種事我早就嘗試過很多次了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,很遺憾 奧村老師應當接受的現實並不是過去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.49,0:20:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而你卻應當接受過去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.93,0:20:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,對方越想要就越不給 越不想要就越要給
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:20:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是這個性格
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你也太壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那是當然
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,少在這說廢話 趕緊過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,棋子都開始去履行自己的使命了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.66,0:21:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,告別了短暫的和平
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「我們是如何誕生的」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.59,0:21:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,「父親母親是怎樣的人」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.67,0:21:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,「我必須知道」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.25,0:21:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我等很久了 奧村
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,等你說出這句話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
